cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Architectural Design Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Concept-stage architectural design as code. A parametric design model written in Python
  generates a standards-based CAD drawing set (DXF, PDF, PNG), a furnished interactive
  three.js model and a verified area schedule. Circulation reachability, door-swing
  clearance, area limits, area-schedule closure and DXF validity are enforced as a build gate.
